      "description": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 28 Fortitude save</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d8</span> poison damage plus Enfeebled 2 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d8</span> poison damage plus enfeebled 2 and Drained 1 (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d8</span> poison damage plus enfeebled 2 and Drained 2 (<span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds)</p>",
