  ],
  "spellcastingEntries": [],
  "description": "<p>Many benign puffball fungi cling to the detritus of forest floors in Darklands caverns. These fungi's giant versions are more mobile and dangerous.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>When this fungus detects prey, its tendrils writhe and exude a paralytic toxin.</p>",
